    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kakuro is one of the most popular puzzle games of all time. A great game for training your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to enter one number from 1 to 9 in all available cells so that, firstly, the sum of the numbers in each block matches the specified number, and secondly, so that in each block all the numbers are different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The popular Japanese puzzle game Kakuro is based on the logical arrangement of numbers. All you need is your brain and the ability to concentrate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game contains 900 levels of varying difficulty and size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game hint system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saving level progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing background music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful space game design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music volume settings, sound effects and screen resolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple, user-friendly interface</p></li></ul>",
